    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοιχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set in a row</i>, esp. <i>set a row of poles with
			nets</i> to drive the game into, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.8
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστοιχίζω</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be set in rows</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστιχ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				42.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>order</i> or <i>arrange in system</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπους μαντικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					484
				</span></i>
			.</div>
